  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=90><b>ETERNAL REALMS: SHADOWFALL</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=45>A
    tale of light and shadow.\r\nWhere courage meets destiny.</size>\r\n\r\n<size=60><b>DEVELOPED
    BY: LIEU QUI CHUONG\n\t\t\t\tNGUYEN  PHI TRUONG</b></size>\n\n\n\n\n\r\n---------------------------------\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=45>\r\n<b>Lead
    Designer:</b> Lieu Qui Chuong\r\n<b>Programming:</b> Nguyen Phi Truong\r\n<b>Art
    Director:</b> Internet\r\n<b>Concept Artists:</b> Internet\r\n<b>3D Modelling
    & Texturing:</b> Internet\r\n<b>Animation:</b> Nguyen Phi Truong\r\n<b>UI / UX
    Design:</b> Lieu Qui Chuong\r\n<b>Sound & Music:</b> Internet\r\n</size>\r\n\r\n<size=40><b>SPECIAL
    THANKS</b></size>\r\n<size=30>\r\n - To all teachers at VTC Academy.\r\n - To
    early playtesters & supporters.\r\n - To the RPG dev community.\r\n - To family
    & friends for their support.\r\n</size>\r\n\r\n<size=40><b>TOOLS & PIPELINE</b></size>\r\n<size=30>\r\n
    - Unity Engine\r\n - Blender, Substance Painter\r\n - Visual Studio / JetBrains
    Rider\r\n - Git for version control\r\n</size>\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\n<size=45><i>\u201CWhere
    shadows fall, light prevails.\u201D</i></size>\r\n\r\n<size=60><b>Thank you for
    playing!</b></size>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
